{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C", "description": "This file implements backend APIs for managing Ethernet interfaces, links, VLAN terminations, and related telemetry logging in the COSA Data Model. It handles creation, initialization, registration, and removal of Ethernet-related data objects, along with reading/writing persistent configuration data. Also includes a telemetry thread for logging Ethernet WAN enablement status.", "external_files": ["cosa_ethernet_internal.h", "<syscfg/syscfg.h>", "safec_lib_common.h", "<unistd.h>"], "external_methods": ["CosaDmlEthInit", "CosaDmlEthPortGetNumberOfEntries", "CosaDmlEthPortGetEntry", "CosaDmlEthPortSetValues", "CosaDmlEthLinkGetNumberOfEntries", "CosaDmlEthLinkGetEntry", "CosaDmlEthLinkSetValues", "CosaSListPushEntryByInsNum", "CosaEthLinkRegGetInfo", "CosaEthVlanTerminationRegGetInfo", "CosaEthVlanTerminationRegAddInfo", "CosaEthVlanTerminationRegDelInfo", "g_GetRegistryRootFolder"], "published": ["CosaEthernetCreate", "CosaEthernetInitialize", "CosaEthernetRemove", "CosaEthLinkRegGetInfo", "CosaEthVlanTerminationRegGetInfo", "CosaEthVlanTerminationRegAddInfo", "CosaEthVlanTerminationRegDelInfo", "CosaEthPortGetAssocDevices"], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "ANSC_HANDLE CosaEthernetCreate(VOID)", "description": "Creates and initializes a new COSA Ethernet object, setting up function pointers and internal state.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "ANSC_STATUS CosaEthernetInitialize(ANSC_HANDLE hThisObject)", "description": "Initializes the Ethernet object, reads existing configuration, and sets up the internal data structures such as Ethernet ports, links, and VLAN terminations. Also loads existing data from persistent storage.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "ANSC_STATUS CosaEthernetRemove(ANSC_HANDLE hThisObject)", "description": "Cleans up and frees resources associated with the Ethernet object.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "ANSC_STATUS CosaEthLinkRegGetInfo(ANSC_HANDLE hThisO